Falsifies `capability_manifest_note::verification::decode_never_panics_through_a_serviced_descriptor`.

The defect: `check_serviced` takes a zone's bytes by indexing rather than by `get`, trusting the
length byte. A note's descriptor is a file anyone could have written, so a zone whose length byte
runs past the end of the descriptor reads out of bounds.

Expected to fail: an index out of bounds in `check_serviced`.

